[{"answer":"So we've been talking about different techniques of preserving artifacts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I'd like to talk about an interesting case study","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"on the preservation of an artifact called the Palimpsest of Archimedes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you've heard of Archimedes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"one of the leading scientists in classical antiquity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"He lived more than 2,000 years ago in Greece.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"He was regarded as one of the greatest mathematicians of history.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"He figured out how to mathematically calculate the surface area and volume of a sphere,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and an accurate approximation of pi.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Unfortunately, not much of his work survived the passage of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He originally printed his findings on papyrus,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"which was a processed and woven river reed fiber.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"This material greatly decayed over time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and his original scrolls were mostly lost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"What had survived had been brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, in 1906, a Palimpsest of Archimedes' writing was discovered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Excuse me! Professor!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"What is a Palimpsest?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, Parchment is made of animal skins that had been stretched tightly and dried.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Scholars used to take parchment that already had writing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"then wash it off with milk and write over the now-clean surface.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to understand that back then paper was uncommon for writing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Instead, parchment was used for all the writing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, the interesting thing is that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"after the ink had been sitting on parchment for a long enough time, it soaks in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And as the parchment aged, it dehydrated, making it lose much of its flexibility.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"However, that extra drying time also made any captured inks within the skin rise to the surface.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So, seven hundred years later,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"someone washed away a log of Archimedes' greatest work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"the letters and diagrams reappeared under the new letters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It is now known as \"The Archimedes Palimpsest\",","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and is probably by far the most important palimpsest anyone has found.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It contains the only known existing copy of Archimedes' finest work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"In it, he shows how mathematics can be applied to physical reasoning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"In 1906, the palimpsest was put on auction,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"selling for 2 million dollars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Luckily, it was not tucked away in a private collection.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The buyer agreed to have experts restore every single word Archimedes had written.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, his words can be shared with the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Unfortunately, we still have some problems with this Palimpsest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Can anyone guess what they are?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Susan!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's been in storage for a long time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"probably not getting the proper care.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/45.mp3"},{"answer":"It's probably super crumbly, or moldy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of it's moldy, some of it's been attacked by bugs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The poor thing really went through the ringer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"On top of that, there is another problem with this Palimpsest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes! John?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"The letters on it aren't readable?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Essentially, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Many archaeologists have used a variety of techniques such as Ultraviolet light","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"to try to make the letters more legible, but that didn't always work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Fortunately, a physicist stepped forward - Bergman.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"This guy was doing research on the iron within spinach leaves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"He proposed an idea that was very similar to how he was looking at iron in spinach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"He realized that the iron in the ancient ink would display","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"if exposed to a certain X-ray imaging method,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"except for small portions of the text that couldn't be deciphered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, with this technique, much of Archimedes' texts and drawings were revealed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/lecture-archimedes-palimpsest-2023-08-25-10-59-46/62.mp3"}]
